 {
  "translated_term": "Интернет-Людские Науки - ӈаҥы ӈиркэтэй ӈиркэтэй",
  "translation_rationale": "Дигитал Хьюманİтис - Интернет, өнүн аналыгын, людские науки, өнүн аналыгын аналыгын аналыгын."
}

Explanation:
The term "Digital Humanities" is translated into Selkup as "Интернет-Людские Науки - ӈаҥы ӈиркэтэй ӈиркэтэй". The first part, "Интернет", translates to "Интернет" itself as it is an international term. The second part, "Людские Науки", translates to "Людские" (human) and "Науки" (sciences), which together mean "Human Sciences". The third part, "ӈаҥы ӈиркэтэй ӈиркэтэй", is a compound phrase that translates to "Дигитал Хьюманİтис" in English. It combines "ӈаҥы" (digital) and "ХүмәнИтис" (Humanities), which together mean "Digital Humanities". The rationale provided explains the translation of each part separately.

 {
  "translated_term": "Wiyik'a Nümüwu K'eewi",
  "translation_rationale": "Digital Humanities įsäk'a nümüwu k'eewi, wiyik'a yan 'digital' (elektronik), yan 'humanities' (nümüwu) yan 'scholarship' (k'eewi). Wiyik'a nümüwu k'eewi yan nümüwu yan elektronik teknologija yan nümüwu yan k'eewi yanäk'a wiyik'a yanäk'a nümüwu yanäk'a k'eewi."
}

