 {
  "translated_term": "Ziibi-minis Aazhaawe'igan",
  "translation_rationale": "Digital Humanities įšķēt vispastrākajiem vietām, kas tiekļot digitalizētais tehnoloģijām un tās izstrādājumu un izmantojumu humanitārām viedošajām dziedošanās. Ziibi-minis Aazhaawe'igan - šī terminis aizstāta, lai ģenerētu zvaigzneiņu un izstrādātu digitalizētas tehnoloģijas humanitārām viedošajām dziedošanās pieejamības. Ziibi - 'viesulis', minis - 'čiprs', Aazhaawe'igan - 'darbība'. Tādēļ, Ziibi-minis Aazhaawe'igan - 'Digital Humanities'."
}

 {
  "translated_term": "Ziibi-minis-ikinoomaage-gikinoo'amaagoziwin",
  "translation_rationale": "Digital (ziibi) refers to something related to technology or computers. Humanities (minis-ikinoomaage) is the study of human culture and society, including literature, history, philosophy, and art. Gikinoo'amaagoziwin means 'ways of knowing'. So, Digital Humanities can be translated as Ziibi-minis-ikinoomaage-gikinoo'amaagoziwin, which means 'ways of knowing related to technology and human culture and society'."
}

 {
  "translated_term": "Binesi-gikinoomaage-wininiyaa-aakozi-mino-bimaadiziike-niimi'idiwag",
  "translation_rationale": "Digital (binesi) refers to technology and data, Humanities (gikinoomaage-wininiyaa) refers to the study of human culture and society, aakozi means 'of', mino means 'world', bimaadiziike means 'scholarship' or 'knowledge', niimi'idiwag means 'related to'. So, Digital Humanities in Ojibwa can be translated as 'Scholarship related to the digital world of human culture and society.'"
}

 {
  "translated_term": "Digital Humanitats",
  "translation_rationale": "La traducciòn del terme 'Digital Humanities' en occità es 'Digital Humanitats'. Aquest terme s'ha creat per indicar l'estudi de les humanitats a través de les tecnologies digitals. En occità, la paraula 'humanitats' és traduïda com a 'umanitats', però en aquest cas es manté el terme original anglès per mantenir la consistència amb la terminologia internacional."
}

 {
  "translated_term": "Ingqulo eNkosikazi yaseDigital",
  "translation_rationale": "Ingqulo eNkosikazi yaseDigital is a translation of the English term 'Digital Humanities'. The term 'Ingqulo' means 'field of study', while 'eNkosikazi' refers to 'humanities'. In this context, 'yaseDigital' indicates that it pertains to digital technology."
}

 {
