 {
  "translated_term": "ግራነ ባህል",
  "translation_rationale": "ግራነ (Digital) ባህል (Humanities) ይመረጃ፤ ግራነ በማስተኛ በመረጃ በባህል በሚያመረጃ፤"
}

Explanation:
The term "Digital Humanities" is translated into Nuer as "ግራነ ባህል". The word "ግራነ" (Girana) means digital, and "ባህል" (Bahil) means humanities. The translation is derived from the English term by translating each component separately. The rationale for this translation is provided in Nuer: "ግራነ (Digital) በማስተኛ በመረጃ በባህል በሚያመረጃ፤" which means "Digital (in English) is used in the context of humanities (in English)".

 {
  "translated_term": "Ditsonga ba Dikgomo",
  "translation_rationale": "Digital Humanities ke lefoko ya dikgomo tse di feta, ke leboga tsa ditsonga tse di feta. Ke leboga tsa Ditsonga ba Dikgomo e tla kgetha re dikgomo tse di feta, tseba hore tseba tse di feta tse tla kgetha re makgotla tse di feta, tseba hore tseba tse di feta tse tla kgetha re mokgatle tse di feta. Ditsonga ba Dikgomo e tla kgetha re dikgomo tse di feta ke leboga tsa ditsonga tse di feta."
}

